---
import "../../src/styles/ui.css";
const title = "Host f.ads — installation guide";
---
<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="description" content="Run your own f.ads reader on Cloudflare." /><link rel="canonical" href={new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site ?? Astro.url)} /><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" /><title>{title}</title></head><body><main><nav><a class="wordmark" href="/">f.ads</a><a href="/">Back to the garden</a></nav><section class="intro"><p>Host your own</p><h1>Your reading surface, on your own origin.</h1><p>f.ads is a self-hosted reader for one owner. It connects a single ATProto identity and RSS sources; your sources, feedback, and saved pieces stay in your installation.</p></section><section class="steps" aria-label="Installation steps"><article><span>1</span><h2>Choose your identity</h2><p>Use the DID for the ATProto account you want to read through. f.ads requests read-only access.</p></article><article><span>2</span><h2>Prepare Cloudflare</h2><p>Install the Cloudflare CLI and create the resources named in the project configuration.</p></article><article><span>3</span><h2>Set your origin and key</h2><p>Set the public origin, owner DID, and OAuth key material in your private deployment environment.</p></article><article><span>4</span><h2>Deploy, then sign in</h2><p>Deploy to your own Cloudflare account, open your origin, and connect the identity you chose.</p></article></section><section class="exact"><h2>Use the repository for exact commands.</h2><p>The setup values depend on your domain and Cloudflare account. The README keeps the command sequence and required bindings current.</p><a href="https://github.com/sdawka/fads#host-your-own" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open the README source</a></section></main></body></html>
<style>:global(*){box-sizing:border-box}:global(body){background:var(--background);color:var(--foreground);font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;margin:0}main{margin:auto;max-width:76rem;padding:1.4rem max(1.25rem,calc((100vw - 76rem)/2)) 6rem}nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}nav a{color:inherit;font-weight:650} .wordmark{font-family:var(--font-display,system-ui);font-size:1.65rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.08em;text-decoration:none}.intro{padding:7rem 0 5rem}.intro>p:first-child{color:var(--primary);font-weight:750}.intro h1,.exact h2{font-family:var(--font-display,system-ui);font-size:clamp(3.8rem,9vw,7.5rem);letter-spacing:-.075em;line-height:.86;margin:.6rem 0;max-width:10ch}.intro>p:last-child{font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.6;max-width:42rem}.steps{border-top:1px solid #cfd0d8;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.steps article{border-bottom:1px solid #cfd0d8;min-height:16rem;padding:2rem}.steps article:nth-child(odd){border-right:1px solid #cfd0d8}.steps span{color:var(--primary);font-weight:750}.steps h2{font-family:var(--font-display,system-ui);font-size:2.2rem;letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:.95}.steps p,.exact p{color:var(--muted-foreground);line-height:1.55;max-width:28rem}.exact{background:var(--lime);margin-top:4rem;padding:clamp(2rem,6vw,5rem)}.exact h2{font-size:clamp(2.8rem,6vw,5rem)}.exact a{font-weight:750}@media(max-width:620px){.intro{padding-block:4rem}.steps{display:block}.steps article:nth-child(odd){border-right:0}}</style>
